# Normal text let sit to auto
*.htm text
*.html text
*.css text
*.js text

## Declare files that will always have LF (aka \n aka 10 aka 0x0a) line endings on checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf

## declare data files binary so git never rewrites their contents
*.parquet binary
